  "ticker": [
    "WELCOME TO THE 2022 B.B.G.C. \u2014 Twenty-three teams across four groups \u2014 Blue, Red and Yellow with six, Orange with five. Three from each move on to the bracket.",
    "GROUP PLAY \u00b7 BLUE \u2014 Royale w/ Cheese went through it without a scratch: 5-0, the only perfect record in the tournament. The Seekers took second at 4-1 and Mickey the Mitcher edged in at 2-2-1. Banana the Tailpipe never got off the mark. ROYALE W/ CHEESE, THE SEEKERS and MICKEY THE MITCHER advance.",
    "GROUP PLAY \u00b7 RED \u2014 Smug Champs, the defending champions, looked every bit of it at 4-1. Behind them a genuine traffic jam: Bro's Boor and Brainerd Bergs both 2-2-1, with Steve + Jake, Guns 'n Rollers and Top Gun all at 2-3. Fine margins everywhere. SMUG CHAMPS, BRO'S BOOR and BRAINERD BERGS advance.",
    "GROUP PLAY \u00b7 YELLOW \u2014 The Hawkeyes did not lose a game: 4-0-1, the only unbeaten card in the group stage. White Zin were right there at 3-1-1. Vandalay took the last ticket. HAWKEYES, WHITE ZIN and VANDALAY advance.",
    "GROUP PLAY \u00b7 ORANGE \u2014 Five teams, four games each. Muck Fichigan came out on top at 3-1, and then a straight tie for second: Big LeBocce and Be-Yotch-e, Please, both 2-2. Sparty Devils and Billy G.O.A.T. both 1-2-1. MUCK FICHIGAN, BIG LeBOCCE and BE-YOTCH-E, PLEASE advance.",
    "ROUND ONE \u2014 Brainerd Bergs edged out Mickey the Mitcher. The Seekers ended Vandalay. Big LeBocce upset Bro's Boor. And Be-Yotch-e, Please sent WHITE ZIN home in the first game they played. The eleven seed over the six.",
    "QUARTERFINALS \u2014 Hawkeyes held firm over Big LeBocce, Smug Champs saw off Be-Yotch-e, and Muck Fichigan ended The Seekers. But the shock of the day came at the top of the board: BRAINERD BERGS TOOK DOWN ROYALE W/ CHEESE. Five and oh in the group, number one seed, out in a single game.",
    "SEMIFINALS \u2014 Brainerd Bergs weren't done \u2014 they ended Muck Fichigan too. And the Hawkeyes stopped the defending champion Smug Champs cold. An eight seed and a two seed for the trophy.",
    "THE FINAL \u2014 Hawkeyes: 4-0-1, the group stage's only unbeaten team, 2018 champions chasing a second. Brainerd Bergs: eighth seed out of a logjammed Red group, and a bracket run that had already buried the number one seed and a group champion.",
    "\ud83c\udfc6 CHAMPIONS: BRAINERD BERGS \ud83c\udfc6 \u2014 They came in eighth. They beat the top seed, they beat a group champion, and then they beat the only team that hadn't lost all day. The Hawkeyes' second title will have to wait. 2022 goes to the Brainerd Bergs."
